{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13656","headline":"同王徴君湘中有怀 · 严维","name":"同王徴君湘中有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八月洞庭秋，潇湘水北流。\n还家万里梦，爲客五更愁。\n不用看书帙，偏宜上酒楼。\n故人京洛满，何日复同游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13656.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13656","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}